|onion]], [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]]\n*3–4 [[Cookbook:Turnip|turnips]], pared and [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n*1 cups (150 g) [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n*Marjoram\n*[[Cookbook:Habanero|Habañero]], [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]], and [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]] to taste\n*2 white [[Cookbook:Potato|potatoes]], peeled and quartered\n*1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] minced [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n*Parsley for garnish\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine chicken, rice, onions, turnips, sugar, marjoram, salt, habañero, and pepper in a pot. Bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] for 100 minutes. \n#Add potatoes, and simmer for 40 additional minutes.\n#Add minced parsley, and adjust seasonings to taste.\n#Serve hot, garnished with sprigs of double parsley.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using whole chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using habanero chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using marjoram]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Chicken Soup with Rice and Potatoes","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 whole chicken, cleaned","sourceText":"1 whole chicken, cleaned","amountText":"1 whole chicken, cleaned","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 quarts (0.8 litres) water","sourceText":"1 quarts (0.8 litres) water","amountText":"1 quarts (0.8 litres) water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1.5 cups (125 g) uncooked rice","sourceText":"1.5 cups (125 g) uncooked rice","amountText":"1.5 cups (125 g) uncooked rice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 onion, minced","sourceText":"1 onion, minced","amountText":"1 onion, minced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3–4 turnips, pared and diced","sourceText":"3–4 tu